{
  "slug": "stock-analysis-aisa",
  "name": "Stock Analysis Aisa",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered stock and crypto analysis plugin powered by AIsa API. Features include: 8-dimension scoring with BUY/HOLD/SELL signals, dividend analysis with safety scores, portfolio management with live P&L tracking, watchlist with price alerts, Hot Scanner for trending stocks and crypto, and Rumor Scanner for M&A rumors, insider activity, and analyst signals. Supports both US stocks and major cryptocurrencies via Yahoo Finance data.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **7 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `stock-analysis` (Analyze stocks and cryptocurrencies with 8-dimension scoring via AIsa API), `stock-dividend` (Analyze dividend metrics for stocks via AIsa API), `stock-hot` (Hot Scanner — find the most trending and high-momentum stocks and crypto right now via AIsa API), `stock-portfolio` (Manage investment portfolios with live P&L tracking via AIsa API), `stock-rumors` (Rumor Scanner — find early signals including M&A rumors, insider activity, analyst upgrades/downgrades, social whispers, and SEC/regulatory activity…), `stock-watchlist` (Manage a stock/crypto watchlist with price target and stop-loss alerts via AIsa API)\n- **Commands** (7): `portfolio` (Manage investment portfolios with live P&L (e.g., /stock-analysis-aisa:portfolio show)), `stock-compare` (Compare multiple stock/crypto tickers side-by-side (e.g., /stock-analysis-aisa:stock-compare AAPL MSFT GOOGL)), `stock-dividend` (Analyze dividend metrics for a stock (e.g., /stock-analysis-aisa:stock-dividend JNJ PG KO)), `stock-hot` (Find trending stocks & crypto right now (Hot Scanner)), `stock-rumors` (Find early signals, M&A rumors, insider activity (Rumor Scanner)), `stock-watch` (Manage watchlist with price alerts (e.g., /stock-analysis-aisa:stock-watch add AAPL --target 220 --stop 160)), `stock` (Analyze a stock or crypto ticker (e.g., /stock-analysis-aisa:stock AAPL))\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install stock-analysis-aisa@claude-community` from `0xjordansg-yolo/stock-analysis-aisa-claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
